  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WE EMPOWER CROATIAN CHILDREN TO OVERCOME FEARS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our project is entering the fourth phase, with the purpose of solving children&apos;s fears, especially the fear of earthquakes and viral diseases, and preventing serious mental illnesses as a result. We are organizing a new group of workshops in the Zagreb City Libraries called &apos;Rico&apos;s paw of support&apos; with the help of therapy dog Rico and psychologist. At each workshop, 25 children will learn about their emotions in a fun way, because they are the key to understanding their own fears.</narrative>
  </description>
